mocratic lean.\n\nOhio's Republican lean and Ramaswamy's large financial advantage, with far more money raised and banked, keep the race competitive, and outside groups are pouring resources into both sides. The open seat and a midterm environment that has favored the out-of-power party work in Acton's favor. The forecast expects a narrow Democratic margin with meaningful uncertainty, as the polling lead has been consistent but the state's fundamentals remain hostile.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.545, "margin": 0.49}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.5929, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.5919, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6166, "margin": 1.3}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.5684, "margin": 1.2}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.592, "margin": 1.4}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6233, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6597, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.662, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6672, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6954, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6965, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.7208, "margin": 2.7}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6724, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6809, "margin": 2.7}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.7082, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.7607, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.7343, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.7436, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.7448, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.7476, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6888, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.6987, "margin": 2.7}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.714, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.711, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.6947, "margin": 2.8}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.7206, "margin": 3.2}, {"dat